  "[action] Wang Lung sits and smokes pipe",
  "[says] Wang Lung asks his sons to tell him about the town.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Tell me a little more about this town, my sons. How do men live in these days?\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung listens to his sons.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now and it is a good thing that you have this market, for there is no need now for these silver rings on your fingers. What need is there for them if you can put your money into good lands and good goods?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and I have some silver and gold yet, and what shall I do with it?\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits on bench",
